meta {
  name: Modifier un role (PIN requis)
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/api/roles/{{created_role_id}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
}

body {
  {
    "label": "Role Demo {{run}} v2",
    "permission_ids": [
      "{{examplePermissionId}}"
    ],
    "visible_sources": [
      "counter",
      "drive"
    ],
    "pin_email": "{{pin_email}}",
    "pin": "{{pin}}"
  }
}

docs {
Garde-fou anti-lockout (422) : le role 'admin' doit garder role.manage et rester actif -- non pertinent ici (role fraichement cree, pas 'admin').
}
